// M9C launch scenario — m9c_full_strongpoint.
// Spec Gherkin: "Determinism across full M9C strongpoint scenario"
// (VAL-M9C-050) + VAL-CROSS-005 (scenario integrates M9B trench
// segments) + VAL-CROSS-006 (cross-spec determinism).
//
// SEED IS FIXED AT 42 — the determinism contract requires identical
// event sequences + identical SaveBlob.checksum across two engines
// running this scenario with seed=42 for 3600 ticks.
//
// Scenario shape: 2 MG nests + 1 watchtower_t2 + 6 sandbag walls +
// 1 minefield + barbed wire perimeter + 1 dragon's teeth row. The
// integration test harness (cf-control + cf-mission) drops the
// forward_outpost_with_mgnest M9B trench template + the M9C
// fortifications via scripted cfctl calls at tick 0. The trench
// template's `path_polyline` declares segments at M9B variant ids
// (communication / fire_step / parapet_raised), satisfying
// VAL-CROSS-005. All 16 M9C event kinds are exercised over the
// 3600-tick window.
